    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Brand of Castigation exposes a fragment of your foe's essence, leaving it vulnerable to your rites. Whenever you hit a creature branded by you with a weapon for which you have an active Crimson Rite, you roll an additional Hemocraft die when determining the rite's extra damage.</p>\n<p>In addition, a creature branded by you that has the Incorporeal Movement trait (or a similar trait) can't move through creatures or objects while branded.</p>",
